    "number": 82,
    "summary": "Thus says the Lord, Ye are gods and children of the Most High.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "God standeth in the congregation of the mighty; he judgeth among the gods.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 12,
            "text": "TG God, Access to."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "How long will ye judge unjustly, and accept the persons of the wicked? Selah.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 48,
            "end": 55,
            "text": "Prov. 18:5."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Defend the poor and fatherless: do justice to the afflicted and needy.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 42,
            "text": "TG Citizenship."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Deliver the poor and needy: rid them out of the hand of the wicked.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 36
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "They know not, neither will they understand; they walk on in darkness: all the foundations of the earth are out of course.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 54,
            "text": "TG Walking in Darkness."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "I have said, Ye are gods; and all of you are children of the most High.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 53,
            "text": "TG Man, a Spirit Child of Heavenly Father; Man, Potential to Become like Heavenly Father; Sons and Daughters of God; Spirit Creation."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 19
          },
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 44
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "But ye shall die like men, and fall like one of the princes.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "1 Cor. 15:22."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Arise, O God, judge the earth: for thou shalt inherit all nations.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "TG Jesus Christ, Judge."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
